WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.560
- We're celebrating the men
and women serving our country.

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:04.020
And you grew up in a military family,

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:04.890
I was talking to your sister, yeah.

00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:05.940
- I did!
- Yeah.

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:08.160
- My mom was a Drill Sergeant.

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:09.290
My...

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:11.010
- [Kelly] How'd that go over growing up?

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:11.890
That's gotta be hard!

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:14.320
- Tia and I are very disciplined,
I will tell you that.

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:15.160
(audience laughs)

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:19.350
And my dad was a First
Sergeant in the Army, so.

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:20.570
One thing I will tell you,

00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:22.410
we know how to clean!

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:23.243
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:23.243 --> 00:00:25.100
- 'Cause they did not play.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.230
- Oh, my mom wasn't in the
Army, but I know how to clean.

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:28.420
- [Tamera] I heard that!
- Yeah.

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.460
- It's a skill now.
- Toilets, like, everything.

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:32.127
- Oh, did you have to do it
with the toothbrush though?

00:00:32.127 --> 00:00:32.960
- I didn't do the toilet.

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:34.380
No, they had the little...
They had a brush.

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.520
It was really just like a brush,

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:37.260
but it was... It's wrong!

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:38.633
You know what happens in there?

00:00:38.633 --> 00:00:40.015
You know what happens... (laughs)

00:00:40.015 --> 00:00:40.990
- Um, yeah!

00:00:40.990 --> 00:00:42.960
- I earned my roof and my bed.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:43.793
- Yes.

00:00:43.793 --> 00:00:46.950
And every task, it didn't
matter how big or small,

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:48.803
you put the same effort into it.

